{"parse": {"title": "狂想套组-501018", "pageid": 134632, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"狂想套组\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/cd/Item-501012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"狂想套组\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>狂想套组</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#501018</div></div><hr /><div>可获得将可燃点狂想等级提升至MAX所需的全部材料。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\"></div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/620102\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B5%AE%E6%83%B3%E4%B9%8B%E8%8A%BD\" title=\"浮想之芽\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B5%AE%E6%83%B3%E4%B9%8B%E8%8A%BD\" title=\"浮想之芽\"><img alt=\"浮想之芽\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Item-620102.png/100px-Item-620102.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Item-620102.png/150px-Item-620102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Item-620102.png/200px-Item-620102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B5%AE%E6%83%B3%E4%B9%8B%E8%8A%BD\" title=\"浮想之芽\">浮想之芽</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">沉浮于脑内，逐渐清晰的一缕奇想，如今已根植、生长、抽芽。用于角色的狂想或解构。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×125</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/620101\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E6%9C%BA%E4%B9%8B%E7%A7%8D\" title=\"灵机之种\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E6%9C%BA%E4%B9%8B%E7%A7%8D\" title=\"灵机之种\"><img alt=\"灵机之种\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Item-620101.png/100px-Item-620101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Item-620101.png/150px-Item-620101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Item-620101.png/200px-Item-620101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E6%9C%BA%E4%B9%8B%E7%A7%8D\" title=\"灵机之种\">灵机之种</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">孕育于脑内，模糊、不具形状的零星奇想，如今已有破土的可能。用于角色的狂想或解构。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×2400</span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/111006\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E7%BE%8A%E6%AF%9B\" title=\"金羊毛\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E7%BE%8A%E6%AF%9B\" title=\"金羊毛\"><img alt=\"金羊毛\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Item-111006.png/100px-Item-111006.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Item-111006.png/150px-Item-111006.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Item-111006.png/200px-Item-111006.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E7%BE%8A%E6%AF%9B\" title=\"金羊毛\">金羊毛</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">千万人为它葬身海中。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×2</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/111007\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%8C%E8%9B%87%E6%9D%83%E6%9D%96\" title=\"双蛇权杖\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%8C%E8%9B%87%E6%9D%83%E6%9D%96\" title=\"双蛇权杖\"><img alt=\"双蛇权杖\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Item-111007.png/100px-Item-111007.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Item-111007.png/150px-Item-111007.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Item-111007.png/200px-Item-111007.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%8C%E8%9B%87%E6%9D%83%E6%9D%96\" title=\"双蛇权杖\">双蛇权杖</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">它是梦境之河的船桨，曾催眠过一个巨人。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×2</span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/111005\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%92%E5%89%91\" title=\"长青剑\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%92%E5%89%91\" title=\"长青剑\"><img alt=\"长青剑\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/Item-111005.png/100px-Item-111005.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/Item-111005.png/150px-Item-111005.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/Item-111005.png/200px-Item-111005.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%92%E5%89%91\" title=\"长青剑\">长青剑</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">它从未参与宣誓。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/111004\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E5%96%84%E6%81%B6%E4%B9%8B%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"分别善恶之果\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E5%96%84%E6%81%B6%E4%B9%8B%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"分别善恶之果\"><img alt=\"分别善恶之果\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/Item-111004.png/100px-Item-111004.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/Item-111004.png/150px-Item-111004.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/Item-111004.png/200px-Item-111004.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E5%96%84%E6%81%B6%E4%B9%8B%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"分别善恶之果\">分别善恶之果</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">你不可吃那分别善恶之树上的果实。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110204\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8D%E8%85%90%E7%8C%B4%E7%88%AA\" title=\"不腐猴爪\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8D%E8%85%90%E7%8C%B4%E7%88%AA\" title=\"不腐猴爪\"><img alt=\"不腐猴爪\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/Item-110204.png/100px-Item-110204.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/Item-110204.png/150px-Item-110204.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/Item-110204.png/200px-Item-110204.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8D%E8%85%90%E7%8C%B4%E7%88%AA\" title=\"不腐猴爪\">不腐猴爪</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">来自哈拉巴某地的珍稀材料，数量极为稀少。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×2</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110104\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BA%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%80%AA%E7%89%A9\" title=\"床下怪物\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BA%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%80%AA%E7%89%A9\" title=\"床下怪物\"><img alt=\"床下怪物\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Item-110104.png/100px-Item-110104.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Item-110104.png/150px-Item-110104.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Item-110104.png/200px-Item-110104.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BA%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%80%AA%E7%89%A9\" title=\"床下怪物\">床下怪物</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">怪物……怪物！妈妈，帮帮我！我的床底下有一只怪物！用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×2</span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110804\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E9%92%9F%E7%81%B5%E8%B4%A8%E7%93%B6\" title=\"金钟灵质瓶\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E9%92%9F%E7%81%B5%E8%B4%A8%E7%93%B6\" title=\"金钟灵质瓶\"><img alt=\"金钟灵质瓶\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Item-110804.png/100px-Item-110804.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Item-110804.png/150px-Item-110804.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Item-110804.png/200px-Item-110804.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E9%92%9F%E7%81%B5%E8%B4%A8%E7%93%B6\" title=\"金钟灵质瓶\">金钟灵质瓶</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">以灵为质，以体为植。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×2</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110704\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BD%AE%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%B4%E4%B9%8B%E8%8A%AF\" title=\"轮与轴之芯\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BD%AE%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%B4%E4%B9%8B%E8%8A%AF\" title=\"轮与轴之芯\"><img alt=\"轮与轴之芯\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Item-110704.png/100px-Item-110704.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Item-110704.png/150px-Item-110704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Item-110704.png/200px-Item-110704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BD%AE%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%B4%E4%B9%8B%E8%8A%AF\" title=\"轮与轴之芯\">轮与轴之芯</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">钟表的心房内铭刻着“精准”二字。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "狂想套组"}}